# This chart only ever runs inside Linux containers/pods -- CRLF anywhere
# breaks shell scripts baked into ConfigMaps at runtime (real incident
# 2026-08-10: entrypoint.sh got silently CRLF-converted by a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true and no .gitattributes override, causing coturn to
# CrashLoopBackOff with "env: 'sh\r': No such file or directory" -- the
# shebang's own interpreter name got a trailing \r appended). Force LF for
# every text file in this repo, no exceptions.
* text=auto eol=lf
